    "content": "{\"title\": \"Tc99m- DMSA CORTICAL SCINTIGRAPHY\", \"technique\": \"Technique:\", \"normal_findings\": [\"Clinical Indication:  To look for renal scarring.\", \"Static anterior, posterior and oblique views of the kidneys were acquired 3 hours post injection of standard dose of Tc99 m DMSA.\", \"Findings:-\", \"Left kidney appears normal in size and shape and demonstrates normal and uniform cortical tracer uptake. No definite focal or wedge shaped/peripheral defect noted.\", \"Right kidney appears normal in size and shape and demonstrates normal and uniform cortical tracer uptake. No definite focal or wedge shaped/peripheral defect noted.\", \"Overall circulating background tracer is normal.\", \"Functional Parameters\", \"LEFT KIDNEY\", \"RIGHT KIDNEY\", \"% function:\", \"%\", \"%\"], \"default_impression\": \"IMPRESSION:###LEFT KIDNEY DEMONSTRATES NORMAL CORTICAL FUNCTION AND NO EVIDENCE OF SCARRING.###RIGHT KIDNEY DEMONSTRATES NORMAL CORTICAL FUNCTION AND NO EVIDENCE OF SCARRING.\", \"raw_text\": \"Tc99m- DMSA CORTICAL SCINTIGRAPHY\\nClinical Indication:  To look for renal scarring.\\nTechnique:\\nStatic anterior, posterior and oblique views of the kidneys were acquired 3 hours post injection of standard dose of Tc99 m DMSA.\\nFindings:-\\nLeft kidney appears normal in size and shape and demonstrates normal and uniform cortical tracer uptake. No definite focal or wedge shaped/peripheral defect noted.\\nRight kidney appears normal in size and shape and demonstrates normal and uniform cortical tracer uptake. No definite focal or wedge shaped/peripheral defect noted.\\nOverall circulating background tracer is normal.\\nFunctional Parameters\\nLEFT KIDNEY\\nRIGHT KIDNEY\\n% function:\\n%\\n%\\nIMPRESSION:\\nLEFT KIDNEY DEMONSTRATES NORMAL CORTICAL FUNCTION AND NO EVIDENCE OF SCARRING.\\nRIGHT KIDNEY DEMONSTRATES NORMAL CORTICAL FUNCTION AND NO EVIDENCE OF SCARRING.\"}"
